# Stryker's sandbox + report output, Playwright's output tree, and the Kiro skill
# scratch trees. All are gitignored, but Prettier does not read .gitignore, so a
# leftover sandbox (an interrupted mutation run never cleans it up), a review run, or
# any `npm run test:e2e` makes `npm run lint:prettier` fail. test-results/ is the
# smallest of them and the easiest to miss: Playwright writes .last-run.json there on
# every run, unindented-tail and newline-less, so exactly one generated JSON file is
# enough to fail the check. vitest.config.ts excludes the same trees for the same
# reason.
.stryker-tmp/
reports/
test-results/
.code-review/
